#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:57
msgid ""
"An older version's restore saved <code>%</code> signs incorrectly, which can "
"break permalinks and page layouts."
msgstr ""
"Pemulihan versi lama menyimpan tanda <code>%</code> dengan salah, yang dapat "
"merusak permalink dan tata letak halaman."

#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:61
msgid "Repair now"
msgstr "Perbaiki sekarang"

#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:62
msgid "See what will change"
msgstr "Lihat apa yang akan berubah"

#. translators: %d: number of further damaged values not listed
#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:66
#, php-format
msgid "and %d more"
msgstr "dan %d lainnya"

#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:70
msgid ""
"Cowboy MCP takes a checkpoint first, and you can undo the repair from the "
"Activity tab."
msgstr ""
"Cowboy MCP membuat checkpoint terlebih dahulu, dan Anda dapat membatalkan "
"perbaikan dari tab Aktivitas."

#. translators: %d: number of damaged values
#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:77
#, php-format
msgid "Cowboy MCP is repairing %d damaged value…"
msgid_plural "Cowboy MCP is repairing %d damaged values…"
msgstr[0] "Cowboy MCP sedang memperbaiki %d nilai yang rusak…"

#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:78
msgid "You can leave this page; it finishes in the background."
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh meninggalkan halaman ini; prosesnya selesai di latar belakang."

#. translators: %d: number of repaired values
#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:85
#, php-format
msgid "Cowboy MCP repaired %d value."
msgid_plural "Cowboy MCP repaired %d values."
msgstr[0] "Cowboy MCP memperbaiki %d nilai."

#. translators: %s: URL of the Activity tab
#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:89
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Permalinks and layouts should look right again. Something off? <a "
"href=\"%s\">Undo the repair</a> on the Activity tab."
msgstr ""
"Permalink dan tata letak seharusnya tampil benar lagi. Ada yang salah? <a "
"href=\"%s\">Batalkan perbaikan</a> di tab Aktivitas."

#: admin/class-mcp-repair-notice.php:100
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "Maaf, Anda tidak diizinkan melakukan itu."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:684
msgid "Unknown client"
msgstr "Klien tidak dikenal"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1083
msgid "The OAuth connector is not enabled on this site."
msgstr "Konektor OAuth tidak diaktifkan di situs ini."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1119
msgid ""
"This site has no record of this app. That usually means the site's database "
"was restored or copied from another site. To let the app connect again: "
"under Settings > Cowboy MCP > Connections, pick the app (\"Connect another "
"app\" if the list is not shown) and click \"Enable for 30 minutes\", then "
"use Reconnect in the app and approve it here."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini tidak memiliki catatan tentang aplikasi ini. Biasanya itu berarti "
"database situs dipulihkan atau disalin dari situs lain. Agar aplikasi dapat "
"terhubung lagi: di Pengaturan > Cowboy MCP > Koneksi, pilih aplikasinya "
"(\"Hubungkan aplikasi lain\" jika daftar tidak ditampilkan) dan klik "
"\"Aktifkan selama 30 menit\", lalu gunakan \"Sambungkan ulang\" di aplikasi "
"dan setujui di sini."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1133
msgid "Invalid redirect_uri for this client."
msgstr "redirect_uri tidak valid untuk klien ini."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1142
msgid "You must be an administrator to authorize this connection."
msgstr "Anda harus menjadi administrator untuk mengotorisasi koneksi ini."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1150
msgid ""
"This connection request is missing a required security parameter (PKCE "
"S256). Start the connection again from your AI app."
msgstr ""
"Permintaan koneksi ini tidak memiliki parameter keamanan wajib (PKCE S256). "
"Mulai lagi koneksi dari aplikasi AI Anda."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1154
msgid ""
"This connection request is for a different address than this site's MCP "
"endpoint. Check the server URL in your AI app."
msgstr ""
"Permintaan koneksi ini ditujukan ke alamat yang berbeda dari endpoint MCP "
"situs ini. Periksa URL server di aplikasi AI Anda."

#. translators: %s: host name the app asked to be sent back to
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1163
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This connection would send you to %s, which is not an allowed destination on "
"this site. If you trust that app, an administrator can add its host under "
"Settings > Cowboy MCP > Desktop Connector."
msgstr ""
"Koneksi ini akan mengarahkan Anda ke %s, yang bukan tujuan yang diizinkan di "
"situs ini. Jika Anda memercayai aplikasi tersebut, administrator dapat "
"menambahkan host-nya di Pengaturan > Cowboy MCP > Desktop Connector."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1176
msgid "Security check failed. Please try again."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan keamanan gagal. Silakan coba lagi."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1251
msgid "Connection error"
msgstr "Kesalahan koneksi"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1258
msgid "An application"
msgstr "Sebuah aplikasi"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1290
msgid "Authorize connection"
msgstr "Otorisasi koneksi"

#. translators: %s: application/client name
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1301
#, php-format
msgid "%s wants to connect"
msgstr "%s ingin terhubung"

#. translators: %s: site name
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1305
#, php-format
msgid ""
"It will be able to read and manage %s through the MCP server, acting with "
"your administrator permissions."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi ini akan dapat membaca dan mengelola %s melalui server MCP, "
"bertindak dengan izin administrator Anda."

#. translators: %s: WordPress username
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1310
#, php-format
msgid "Authorizing as %s"
msgstr "Mengotorisasi sebagai %s"

#. translators: %s: host name of the address the browser is sent to after approval, e.g. chatgpt.com
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1315
#, php-format
msgid "After you approve, you will be sent to %s"
msgstr "Setelah Anda menyetujui, Anda akan diarahkan ke %s"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1317
msgid ""
"The app name above is supplied by the app and is not verified. Approve only "
"if you just started this connection yourself."
msgstr ""
"Nama aplikasi di atas diberikan oleh aplikasi itu sendiri dan tidak "
"diverifikasi. Setujui hanya jika Anda baru saja memulai koneksi ini sendiri."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1319
msgid ""
"This site has no stored record of this connection. That is normal after a "
"database restore or a staging sync. If you did not just start this from your "
"AI app, choose Deny."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini tidak memiliki catatan tersimpan tentang koneksi ini. Hal ini "
"wajar setelah pemulihan database atau sinkronisasi staging. Jika Anda tidak "
"baru saja memulainya dari aplikasi AI Anda, pilih Tolak."

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1321
msgid ""
"This site has no record of this app. Approving registers it here and sends "
"you to the address above. That is expected after a database restore or a "
"staging sync for a connection made before Cowboy MCP 1.6.8. If you did not "
"just start this from your AI app, choose Deny."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini tidak memiliki catatan tentang aplikasi ini. Menyetujui akan "
"mendaftarkannya di sini dan mengarahkan Anda ke alamat di atas. Itu wajar "
"setelah pemulihan database atau sinkronisasi staging untuk koneksi yang "
"dibuat sebelum Cowboy MCP 1.6.8. Jika Anda tidak baru saja memulainya dari "
"aplikasi AI Anda, pilih Tolak."

#. translators: %d: number of tools allowed in the connection's current custom scope
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1339
#, php-format
msgid "Keep current custom scope (%d tools)"
msgstr "Pertahankan cakupan kustom saat ini (%d alat)"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1345
msgid "Full access — read and manage the site"
msgstr "Akses penuh — baca dan kelola situs"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1349
msgid "Read-only — inspect the site, make no changes"
msgstr "Hanya baca — periksa situs, tanpa membuat perubahan"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1353
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Tolak"

#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1354
msgid "Approve"
msgstr "Setujui"

#. translators: %s: redirect URI
#: includes/class-mcp-oauth.php:1359
#, php-format
msgid "Redirects to: %s"
msgstr "Mengalihkan ke: %s"

